our ability to engage suppliers of equipment components and network services on a timely basis and on commercially reasonable terms, including, without limitation, electronic components such as semiconductor memory and storage products (among others, dynamic random access memory (“DRAM”) and NAND flash memory), due to the surging buildout of artificial intelligence-related computing infrastructure;

